for three tokens on Soy_Peptone: `Phytone peptone`, `Phytone peptone (BD-BBL)`, and `Soytone (BD-Difco) or Phytone peptone (BD-BBL)`. The third expresses alternatives. Do not merge owners, copy shared-ID occurrence memberships, or treat export suppression alone as a repair of false exact synonyms. Other Soy/Corn claims remain within their own review scope.\n\nSources: [official MicrO term](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/ontologies/micro/terms?obo_id=MICRO:0001795), [TOGO M2989](https://togomedium.org/medium/M2989), [manufacturer guide](https://documents.thermofisher.com/TFS-Assets/BPD/brochures/peptones-supplements-feeds-technical-reference-guide.pdf).\n\nIndependent full-owner scope review is recorded in `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/existing-owner-scope-decisions-v1/`; decisions SHA256 `150af7315aa6688d4bc9adb3e2a27d0a0835ec8f8ac33d65b8951712b0382d81`, manifest `c664e35067692c0aa46c4570ec688ffba9281e692337cfa5de1e4f014dc2ce54`. The coordinator rehashed all 89 manifest members. This is a sourced conclusion for candidate preparation; final exact candidate bytes still require native validation and independent review. No maintained records or approvals have changed.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6718503130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6718700751","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1212#issuecomment-6718700751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1212","id":6718700751,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkHc8zw","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"